1
00:00:05,244 --> 00:00:07,984
(All(repeatedly):)Refresh... Refresh...

2
00:00:10,416 --> 00:00:13,456
(Sheldon:)-Refresh.
-Refresh.

3
00:00:13,953 --> 00:00:16,863
Refresh. It's been ten minutes!
We're running out of time.

4
00:00:17,023 --> 00:00:18,863
(Penny:)To be cool? Yeah.

5
00:00:20,259 --> 00:00:21,669
I did it! I did it!
I'm in the queue!

6
00:00:23,463 --> 00:00:26,343
(Sheldon:)And they say firefighters
are the real heroes.

7
00:00:27,433 --> 00:00:29,273
(Raj:)What number in line are you?

8
00:00:29,435 --> 00:00:30,645
(Leonard:)-Fifteen...
-Great!

9
00:00:30,803 --> 00:00:32,643
-...thousand, 211.
-Damn!

10
00:00:34,374 --> 00:00:36,684
(Raj:)They only have Thursday
and Sunday passes left.

11
00:00:36,843 --> 00:00:39,053
(Howard:)-Really?
-Thursday's gone. Just Sunday left.

12
00:00:39,212 --> 00:00:41,052
Sunday's the worst!

13
00:00:41,214 --> 00:00:44,054
(Sheldon:)Everybody's leaving,
most of the good panels are over,

14
00:00:44,217 --> 00:00:47,717
(Sheldon:)and the only T-shirts
they have left are small and XXXXL.

15
00:00:50,723 --> 00:00:53,563
(Leonard:)-Sunday's gone.
-Not Sunday! I love Sunday!

16
00:00:56,462 --> 00:00:58,672
(Raj:)So that's it?
Everything's sold cut?

17
00:00:59,732 --> 00:01:02,022
(Penny:)Yeah.

